symbols, smaller on spaced-out punctuation and long ASCII rules. Escaped tabs
and newlines count as repeated units too. A single token's internal repetitions
alone do not trigger the detector. UTF-8 fragments are joined before comparing
symbols, and the short history resets at document boundaries.
