"""Layer 1 MLP down_proj, component 788: an "off" detector.

It fires on the word "off" (" off", "off", "-off", " Off", " OFF") and on words ending
in "off" (playoff, runoff, payoff, kickoff). It is strongest when "off" is a departure or
start sense ("take off", "go off", "kick off", "day off"), weaker after switching verbs
