"""A negative pulse while a document still repeats its opening token.

The pulse disappears on the first different token. Its size uses digits,
whitespace, script, word length/frequency, and capitalized person/place nouns.
These broad classes approximate finer token-specific variation. Small later
activations and exceptional opening bigrams are ignored.
